# TDD

Follow `.cursor/skills/ledgercraft-tdd/SKILL.md`.

- Failing test before production code, including bug fixes (`ledgercraft-tdd`)
- API SQL tests use the temp SQLite file (`api/src/test/harness.ts`). Do not mock Drizzle there. Do not start Docker Postgres for them.
- Invoice create: numbering, lines, totals, journal, idempotency in one transaction
- Standard API error: `{ error: { code, message, requestId } }`
